1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
[Gon] That's Morel's Smoky Jail.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
He said he'd use it
to keep Pouf away from the King.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
If it's covering
the entire third floor of the tower,

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,000
[gasps]

5
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Hmm.

6
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
[opening theme music playing]

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

8
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,000
[singer singing in English]

9
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

10
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,000
[singer singing in English]

11
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

12
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

13
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:39,000
has begun their battles
in their respective locations.

14
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,000
[blows landing]

15
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,000
[Knuckle groans]

16
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,000
[gasps]

17
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,000
[Killua] Grandpa.

18
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,000
That means…

19
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,000
that's the King.

20
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:24,000
but you wish to do so while keeping
human casualties at a minimum.

21
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:06,000
[narrator] The technique was not intended
to hurt the King in any way.

22
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,000
[Zeno roars]

23
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,000
[Gon] Killua.

24
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,000
Pitou is right over there.

25
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,000
Which is it?

26
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:33,000
[narrator] As much as Killua wanted
to ask the question,

27
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,000
he suppressed the urge.

28
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,000
There's no turning back.

29
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:54,000
[narrator] If he could only ask,
then everything would be out in the open.

30
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Anyone with enough experience
would easily arrive at that next step.

31
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:09,000
was unable to utter a single word.

32
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
What's with all that noise?

33
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:51,000
It feels like Sir Pitou's En
disappeared again.

34
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:57,000
Well, I just got back here myself, but,
uh, it seems to me to be an enemy attack.

35
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:59,000
Seriously?

36
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:02,000
Well, I don't think
anything else could have caused this.

37
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,000
[Bloster] Hmm?

38
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,000
What happened to your wings?

39
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:11,000
Oh, uh…
I lost them during the attack earlier.

40
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,000
You going down?

41
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:17,000
Uh, yes.
I have orders from Sir Hagya, you see.

42
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,000
[rumbling]

43
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:35,000
-[Cheetu and Ikalgo gasp]
-[Bloster] It's huge!

44
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,000
[both] Did he say, "Sir Hagya"?

45
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,000
[Shaiapouf] You chose to confine me.

46
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:52,000
Do you still believe
that was the correct choice?

47
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,000
I wouldn't mind finding that out.

48
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:17,000
The correct choice for any good warrior.

49
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,000
However…

50
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:43,000
His lower vigilance
indicates an abundance of confidence.

51
00:10:57,000 --> 00:11:00,000
and making the aura flow distinct.

52
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Now I should introduce myself.

53
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,000
You won't tell me your name, will you?

54
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,000
perhaps even fatally so.

55
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:44,000
And to be quite honest with you,
I find myself feeling a bit hurt.

56
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:48,000
Hmm?

57
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:52,000
But I won't remember when I'm reborn.

58
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,000
[chuckling]

59
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,000
[scoffs]

60
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:24,000
If he wants to waste time,
that's fine by me.

61
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:30,000
I'm ready for whatever demon
or beast emerges.

62
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:07,000
[narrator] Shoot's reckless attacks
without fear for his own life

63
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,000
[narrator] While barely dodging
multiple attacks

64
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:21,000
that would otherwise have been lethal,

65
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:42,000
[narrator] Youpi was unable
to finish off his opponent.

66
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:55,000
Due to the series of mysterious attacks
he could not understand,

67
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:57,000
Youpi took a step back.

68
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] No matter what,

69
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:02,000
I can't let him get
any closer to the King.

70
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:15,000
[narrator] Youpi and Shoot's goals
happened to coincide.

71
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:22,000
Still, this unusual turn of events
only served to greatly torment Knuckle.

72
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:25,000
[Knuckle grunts in frustration]

73
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:29,000
Endure it. I can't strike now.

74
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:34,000
If I attack, I'd only be giving him proof

75
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:46,000
Endure it.

76
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,000
[narrator] Covered in blood,

77
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:21,000
[narrator] …Knuckle couldn't hold back
the tears streaming down his face.

78
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:31,000
It is time. You have accrued interest.

79
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,000
[Knuckle] What?

80
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,000
Only ten seconds have passed?

81
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:52,000
It's taking all my willpower
not to run away.

82
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,000
This must be some kind of joke.

83
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,000
You're kidding, right?

84
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,000
I can't take it anymore!

85
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,000
[roaring]

86
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:29,000
[Knuckle] Seriously?
It's only been ten seconds.

87
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:32,000
But that just might have saved me.

88
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,000
[Meleoron grunts]

89
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:38,000
[narrator] However,
Meleoron wasn't trying to help Knuckle.

90
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:49,000
[Knuckle] Damn it!

91
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:53,000
Oopsie!

92
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:55,000
[Knuckle] He barely scratched me,

93
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:59,000
but even so,
it was more than enough to pay off

94
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:02,000
my first full-strength attack,
plus interest.

95
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:06,000
Shoot is risking his life out there,

96
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,000
[yelling]

97
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:55,000
so if you wanna catch your breath,
this is the time.

98
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,000
[breathes deeply]

99
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:00,000
God's Accomplice, deactivate.

100
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:12,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] What is this,
and when did it get here?

101
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:15,000
There's no way I didn't notice it before.

102
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:17,000
It just suddenly appeared out of nowhere.

103
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,000
Was I hit by an attack?

104
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:22,000
No, that's not it.

105
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:24,000
A delayed effect?

106
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:26,000
Wait. I remember this.

107
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:37,000
Or did it fulfill
the activation condition during battle?

108
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:40,000
What is this number?

109
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:43,000
Is it a countdown, a bomb?

110
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:46,000
Can't be. The number isn't changing.

111
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:50,000
Damn it! What a pain!

112
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:54,000
-[Shoot grunts]
-[gasps]

113
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:59,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] I just need
to get rid of the source.

114
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,000
[Shoot] Something's coming.

115
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:05,000
[narrator] Despite his overwhelming power,

116
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:09,000
there was only one reason
Youpi was unable to defeat Shoot,

117
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,000
an obvious difference in talent.

118
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:20,000
[Shoot] It's fast. I can't get away.

119
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:24,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] One meat skewer
coming right up.

120
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:28,000
Huh?

121
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,000
[scoffs]

122
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:36,000
He hit himself to propel backwards.

123
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:51,000
who wasn't at all the strategic type
to begin with.

124
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:10,000
it was in not realizing that Shoot
was aware of this and was fine with it.

125
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,000
More than that…

126
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:49,000
I can still fly.

127
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:02,000
yet slowly but surely,
he was reaching his limit.

128
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,000
Hmm?

129
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,000
[gasps]

130
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:24,000
[Knuckle] Over here, you bastard!

131
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:30,000
[Meleoron] Knuckle!

132
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:38,000
[Knuckle] I'm giving him proof

133
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:41,000
that there's another enemy
he needs to worry about.

134
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:51,000
and, if we're lucky,
it might even be enough to save Shoot.

135
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:57,000
Bring it on!

136
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,000
[closing theme music playing]

137
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:04,000
[narrator] After he'd taken a moment
to calm down and regain his composure,

138
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:12,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

139
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:38,000
-[Gon] Right here.
-[Killua] Wait. You disappeared again.

140
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:42,000
[Gon] Perfect Plan, deactivate!
I'm always by your side.

141
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:45,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
